    "body": "## Is there a related GitHub Issue?\r\nNo\r\n\r\n## What is this change about?\r\nRename ADR files to eliminate numbering duplication. Add a new ADR recording the decision to use Contour for Ingress in the absence of a stable Gateway API release.\r\n\r\n## Does this PR introduce a breaking change?\r\nNo\r\n\r\n## Acceptance Steps\r\nRead the ADR and raise any concerns in a review.\r\n\r\n## Tag your pair, your PM, and/or team\r\n@davewalter @akrishna90 \r\n",
